From dcfa83d471f9121f1f49e00544cee0211996837f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Code Review <review@local>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 09:07:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: stuck recent-ledger table, dead chart links in chat,
 generic chat titles

- renderRecentInvoices targeted a nonexistent element id, so the
  dashboard Recent Ledger table stayed on 'Loading...' forever; it now
  renders rows into dashboard-recent-table-body
- Chat responses and stored history are stripped of chart links whose
  HTML file does not exist (they rendered as raw 404 JSON in an iframe)
- Conversations are titled from their first user message instead of
  every chat showing the same fallback label
---
 app/main.py      | 36 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 chat_store.py    | 44 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 static/js/app.js | 34 ++++++++++++++--------------------
 3 files changed, 94 insertions(+), 20 deletions(-)

